menu "Clock scope diagnostic"
config CLOCK_SCOPE_PROBE
    bool "Enable experimental synchronized timing pulses"
    default n
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4 || IDF_TARGET_ESP32C6
    help
        Hardware timer pulses on P4 GPIO45 or endpoint C6 GPIO18.
        P4 requires Waveshare P4-WIFI6-POE-ETH wiring; enables LDO4 at 3.3 V.
        Includes scheduling diagnostics; does not enable FTM discipline.
endmenu
